    value: "swh:1:snp:bcdc4895c9f1a2c16cd7a12fa2ad05ceb4a45dd5"
    description: "Software Heritage snapshot of the essay corpus (intrinsic content-derived identifier, the substitute priority-claim mechanism for the essay genre per authorship-strategy ADR-0013)"
authors:
